let dragon be the list frame take nat_to_whole xii layer
    layer
        cycle entirely by xxiv shift east dragon_tail
        cycle entirely shift_by pos xxi pos vii center_head
    cycle entirely shift_by pos xxvii pos iv layer
        right_half
        for vi rotate entirely
            compose
                shift west
                flip_over_y
            right_half

